<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9637" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεξ-ετάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>try</i> one <i>by the standard of another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.18.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).229
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					52.20
				</span></i>
			; <i>compare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Herm.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			, cf. Aps.<i><span class="en">
				p.247
			</span></i> H., etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be measured</i> or <i>compared,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός
				τι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.65b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.45
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				31.126
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>measure one's strength against</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					12.2
				</span></i>
			: esp. <i>dispute with</i> him <i>at law,</i>
			
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιδικέω</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				29.1
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῇ νόσῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Abd.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
